# Upstream #[test] scenarios (fix/47-all @ 20326c0) replayed as batches through the REAL engine
# (signed units -> Engine::ingest) and the mnpilot port. Each `== name` block is one batch from a
# fresh genesis (BTC_USD, mark 100 000 USD; `m2` also lists market 2 with genesis params + mark
# 100 000). Book/account/state-level tests are driven through Engine::place with deposits added,
# since the batch format only carries deposit/place/cancel ops. Comments note where a test had to
# be approximated (direct state edits, mark moves, market listings, cross-with-margin are not
# expressible). Syntax: engine-diff/src/main.rs `scen_batches`.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- minuend-book (lib.rs tests)
== book_limit_buy_crosses_one_sell
dep A 1000000
dep B 1000000
ask A 100 1
bid B 101 2

== book_partial_fill_then_rest
dep A 1000000
dep B 1000000
ask A 50 0.5
bid B 50 1

== book_market_buy_eats_two_ask_levels      # engine: one fill per unit -> MultiFill/IOC path
dep A 1000000
dep B 1000000
ask A 100 1
ask A 101 1
bid B 0 2 mkt

== book_cancel_resting_then_missing_errors
dep A 1000000
bid A 10 1
cancel A 1
cancel A 1

== book_self_trade_cancel_taker             # engine uses SelfTrade::Reject
dep A 1000000
dep B 1000000
ask A 100 1
ask B 100 1
bid A 100 2

== book_escrowed_self_trade_rejects         # margins scaled so the IM gate (mark 100k) passes
dep A 1000000
ask A 100 1 iso=10000
bid A 100 1 iso=10000
bid A 100 1 isou=0

== book_reject_after_prior_maker_match_preserves_book
dep A 1000000
dep B 1000000
ask B 100 1
ask A 100 1 iso=10000
bid A 100 2 iso=20000

== book_price_time_fifo_same_price
